    <Fact path="/form8611Buildings/*/precedingYearQualifiedBasis">
      <Name>Qualified basis at the close of the preceding year (original basis only)</Name>
      <Description>Qualified basis of the building at the close of 2024, figured the same way as /form8611Buildings/*/remainingOriginalQualifiedBasis (without regard to additions after the first year of the credit period). Line 6 is the decrease during the current year, so a building whose basis already fell in an earlier year measures only this year's further decrease. Unanswered: /form8611Buildings/*/precedingYearQualifiedBasisOrFirstYear uses the first-year qualified basis, which is right when no earlier decrease occurred.</Description>
      <Writable>
        <Dollar />
        <Limit type="Min">
          <Dollar>0</Dollar>
        </Limit>
      </Writable>
    </Fact>
